From 60adcc31208a3eb29d2b7c6346b1908aa4f10bbd Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Daniel Golle <daniel@makrotopia.org>
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 17:05:10 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 17/19] feat: configure a shared device UUID for CGI and
 discovery

A device reached through several interfaces needs one endpoint identity.
Accept a configured UUID in text and JSON configurations and through the
discovery command line. Validate and canonicalise the shared value while
retaining MAC-derived identities for existing configurations.

Signed-off-by: Daniel Golle <daniel@makrotopia.org>
