 ### wsd_simple_server
 wsd_simple server supports the following options
 
+Set `device_uuid` in the CGI configuration and pass the same UUID through
+`--uuid` to discovery. This keeps one device identity across network
+interfaces and address families. Generate and persist a distinct UUID for
+each device instance. Omitting it retains MAC-derived identity selection.
